WEBVTT

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.600
After registration, you will get log in credentials to your registered email ID.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.700
You will be receiving welcome to launched global email and open it.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:26.800
You will be receiving this email from credentials at learn.launchglobal.in if not check in spam

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:27.260
folder.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.880
Now click on login here.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.320
Now you will reach to this interface and click on email option.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:37.980
Go back to your email and here launch had already provided username and password.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.800
Copy them and pass to this interface and click on sign in.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:47.300
After sign in, you will reach to this interface where you can able to see the course which

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.240
you have enrolled for.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:53.020
In case if you will not able to access the course, then you need to clear the pending

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.580
amount according to your opted domain.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:59.920
After that click on the domain, we will reach to this page and now click on start lecture.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.580
Now you can access the lecture videos in this page.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:07.500
Make sure after finishing the video, click on mark video as finish and here you can

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.160
access the further lecture videos.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.940
There are some important guidelines.

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:16.940
You are required to watch all the recorded videos in full without skipping as part of the

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:17.840
program requirements.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:22.880
Your progress will be tracked and can be monitored through the LMS portal so it should

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.800
be above 75%.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:29.880
Upon successful completion of the course, you will become eligible to receive the course

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.100
completion certificate.

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:36.640
Additionally, after you submit the major project, you will be eligible to receive the internship

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:37.840
completion certificate.

